- A, B, D and E are all below the 25-employee threshold on the relevant January 1 date(s) or have already satisfied the policy and distribution obligations, so they are compliant.
- C meets the threshold and therefore must maintain both policies, but its practice of revising monthly while distributing only quarterly necessarily violates the 30-day distribution rule for at least some revisions. That is the sole instance of non-compliance as of 2 January 2023.}

